          "Text": "Tunnel wraps any picture round the inside of a tube and flies down it; here the lining is a Checkerboard. The Master Gear in its Time sets the pace, and Shading darkens the far end. Turn Twist and Radius, pick another Path, or cable a different picture into Texture."
